# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "VQE's layout is simple:\n"
msgstr "El esquema de VQE es sencillo:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare reference operators $U_R$\n"
msgstr "Preparar los operadores de referencia $U_R$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We start from the state $|0\\rangle$ and go to the reference state "
"$|\\rho\\rangle$\n"
msgstr ""
"Partimos del estado $|0\\rangle$ y llegamos al estado de referencia "
"$|\\rho\\rangle$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Apply the variational form $U_V(\\vec\\theta_{i,j})$ to create an ansatz "
"$U_A(\\vec\\theta_{i,j})$\n"
msgstr ""
"Aplicar la forma variacional $U_V(\\vec\\theta_{i,j})$ para crear un ansatz "
"$U_A(\\vec\\theta_{i,j})$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We go from the state $|\\rho\\rangle$ to "
"$U_V(\\vec\\theta_{i,j})|\\rho\\rangle = "
"|\\psi(\\vec\\theta_{i,j})\\rangle$\n"
msgstr ""
"Pasamos del estado $|\\rho\\rangle$ a $U_V(\\vec\\theta_{i,j})|\\rho\\rangle"
" = |\\psi(\\vec\\theta_{i,j})\\rangle$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Bootstrap at $i=0$ if we have a similar problem (typically found via "
"classical simulation or sampling)\n"
msgstr ""
"Arranque en $i=0$ si tenemos un problema similar (normalmente obtenido "
"mediante simulación clásica o muestreo)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each optimizer will be bootstrapped differently, resulting in an initial set"
" of parameter vectors $\\Theta_0 := \\\\{ {\\vec\\theta_{0,j} | j \\in "
"\\mathcal{J}_\\text{opt}^0} \\\\}$ (for example, from an initial point "
"$\\vec\\theta_0$).\n"
msgstr ""
"Cada optimizador se inicializará de forma diferente, generando un conjunto "
"inicial de vectores de parámetros $\\Theta_0 := \\\\{ {\\vec\\theta_{0,j} | "
"j \\in \\mathcal{J}_\\text{opt}^0} \\\\}$ (por ejemplo, a partir de un punto"
" inicial $\\vec\\theta_0$).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Evaluate the cost function $C(\\vec\\theta_{i,j}) := \\langle "
"\\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) | \\hat{H} | \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})\\rangle$ for all "
"prepared states on a quantum computer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Evaluar la función de coste $C(\\vec\\theta_{i,j}) := \\langle "
"\\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) | \\hat{H} | \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})\\rangle$ para todos"
" los estados preparados en un ordenador cuántico.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use a classical optimizer to select the next set of parameters "
"$\\Theta_{i+1}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Usar un optimizador clásico para seleccionar el siguiente conjunto de "
"parámetros $\\Theta_{i+1}$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Repeat the process until convergence is reached.\n"
msgstr "Repetir el proceso hasta alcanzar la convergencia.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
