# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Bootstrap at $i=0$ if we have a similar problem (typically found by "
"classical simulation or sampling).\n"
msgstr ""
"Muestrear la función de coste $C(\\vec\\theta) := a_0 + "
"\\sum_{k=1}^S[a_k\\cos(k\\theta)+ b_k\\sin(k\\theta)]$ al menos $T$ veces.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sample the cost function $C(\\vec\\theta) := a_0 + "
"\\sum_{k=1}^S[a_k\\cos(k\\theta)+ b_k\\sin(k\\theta)]$ at least $T$ times.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$T=\\prod_{i=1}^k(2S_i+1)\\leq \\prod_{i=1}^k(2S_{max}+1) = (2S_{max}+1)^n$\n"
msgstr "$T=\\prod_{i=1}^k(2S_i+1)\\leq \\prod_{i=1}^k(2S_{max}+1) = (2S_{max}+1)^n$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Decide whether to over-sample/under-sample to balance speed vs accuracy by "
"adjusting $T$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Decidir si realizar sobremuestreo/submuestreo para equilibrar velocidad "
"frente a precisión ajustando $T$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compute the Fourier coefficients from the samples (that is, solve the "
"normalized linear system of equations).\n"
msgstr ""
"Calcular los coeficientes de Fourier a partir de las muestras (es decir, "
"resolver el sistema de ecuaciones lineales normalizado).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Solve for the global minimum of the resulting regression function on a "
"classical machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"Resolver el mínimo global de la función de regresión resultante en una "
"máquina clásica.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
